@startuml

title EduSurvey - Complete and Submit Course Evaluation

actor Student
participant "EduSurvey" as System
database "Database" as DB

Student -> System: Sign in
System -> DB: Verify credentials and Student role
DB --> System: Authentication result

alt Authentication successful
    System -> DB: Get assigned evaluations\nand response status
    DB --> System: Available evaluations
    System --> Student: Display evaluations,\ndeadlines and completion status

    Student -> System: Select evaluation
    System -> DB: Check enrollment, deadline,\nand submission status
    DB --> System: Access status

    alt Evaluation available
        System -> DB: Get evaluation questions
        DB --> System: Evaluation questions
        System --> Student: Display evaluation form

        Student -> System: Submit answers
        System -> System: Validate required answers

        alt Answers valid
            System -> DB: Save response and answers
            DB --> System: Submission saved
            System --> Student: Show confirmation\nStatus = Completed\n(Response within 3 seconds)

        else Answers invalid or incomplete
            System --> Student: Show validation errors
            Student -> System: Correct answers
            Student -> System: Resubmit answers
            System -> System: Validate answers

            alt Corrected answers valid
                System -> DB: Save response and answers
                DB --> System: Submission saved
                System --> Student: Show confirmation\nStatus = Completed\n(Response within 3 seconds)
            else Still invalid
                System --> Student: Show validation errors
            end
        end

    else Deadline passed
        System --> Student: Evaluation closed\nSubmission not allowed

    else Already submitted
        System --> Student: Evaluation already completed\nDuplicate submission not allowed

    else Student not enrolled / not assigned
        System --> Student: Access denied
    end

else Authentication failed
    System --> Student: Show sign-in error
end

Student -> System: Sign out
System --> Student: End session and return to login

@enduml